    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個附贈動作，你可以舉起這張卡片並說出命令語，使你在其後的10分鐘內進行的所有豁免檢定具有優勢。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As a bonus action, you can speak a command word while holding this card aloft to gain advantage on all saving throws you make for the next 10 minutes. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
